---
title:    "Specialization of Inductively Sequential Functional Logic Programs"
citation: "(ICFP 1999)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/ICFP99.html"
date:     1999-01-02 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
